# EchLub Model Policy

## Logical roles

```text
FAST_EXECUTOR
  Default: Composer 2.5 Fast
  Inspection, bounded edits, deterministic implementation, formatting, tests, evidence.

SPECIALIST_REVIEWER
  Fresh context. Read-only. No file changes. Findings with file and evidence references.

STRONG_ARCHITECT
  Deny by default. Requires explicit package authorization.

STRONG_FINAL_CONFLICT_REVIEW
  Exact model: GPT-5.6 Sol High (gpt-5.6-sol-high)
  API-backed. Deny by default. Requires explicit owner authorization per package.
  No fallback model.
```

## Defaults

- API-backed models are forbidden unless the active work package explicitly authorizes them.
- One writer owns implementation per work package.
- Specialist agents remain read-only.
- Persistent Git actions require an explicit owner gate.
